  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n982 − 972 + 962 − 952 + 942 − 932 + ...... 122 − 11²\n\nExpand using identity a² - b² = (a + b)(a - b)\n\n(98 + 97)(98 - 97) + (96 + 95)(96 - 95) + (94 + 93)(94 - 93) + .......................... + (12 + 11)(12 - 11)\n\n(98 + 97) + (96 + 95) + (94 + 93) + .......................... + (12 + 11)\n\nIt is an AP with a = 98, d = -1, and l = 11\n\nTₙ = a + (n - 1)d\n\n11 = 98 + (n - 1)(-1)\n\nSolving this\n\nn = 88\n\nSum = n/2 × (a + l)\n\n88/2 × (98 + 11)\n\nSum = 4796\n\n**∴ Option 2 is the correct answer.**",
